{
  "_note": "AUTHORED-NOT-RUN + DEFERRED (see OBL-001 _note). DCR-BRIDGE NOT YET WIRED: there is no DCR-constraint-zone -> durable-obligation bridge in wos-runtime (obligations.rs has no DCR coupling; advanced.DCR lives elsewhere and is not consumed by the obligation monitor). Until that bridge exists this fixture only exercises the ordinary obligation activation path so it parses and runs green; the intended DCR semantics (a DCR pending activity that cannot be excluded materializing/688 satisfying a durable obligation) MUST be authored once the bridge lands. Reserve id WOS-CONF-2311 for that work. Do NOT treat this as covering DCR.",
  "id": "WOS-CONF-2311-OBL-011-dcr-bridge",
  "rule": "WOS-OBL-RUNTIME-0903",
